// Suspicious LDAP-Attributes Used | T1001.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/win_security_susp_ldap_dataexchange.yml
winlog.channel:Security AND (event.code:5136 AND winlog.event_data.AttributeValue:* AND (winlog.event_data.AttributeLDAPDisplayName:(primaryInternationalISDNNumber OR otherFacsimileTelephoneNumber OR primaryTelexNumber)))
